  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 402.07 Cathodic protection tester",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.07 “Cathodic protection tester” means an individual who is certified by NACE International, the Steel Tank Institute, or the International Code Council as being qualified to evaluate the effectiveness of cathodic protection of buried metal tanks and piping systems.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 402.05) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
